# Screenshots are regenerated by docs/capture.sh in about two and a half
# minutes. Eighteen PNGs is roughly 2.4 MB of churn per verification pass, so
# the batch stays out of git and only the handful referenced by README.md and
# docs/CLAUDE.md are committed, by name, in docs/.
docs/shots/

# Python build artefacts of running the two generators.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# macOS
.DS_Store
